user zz additional (.array~of(bad)) off raised
user zz additional (.array~of(bad)) r raised
user zz additional (.array~of(bad)) i 98.900
user zz array (bad) off raised
user zz array (bad) r raised
user zz array (bad) i 98.900
syntax 40.4 additional (.array~of(bad)) off 98.900
syntax 40.4 additional (.array~of(bad)) r 98.900
syntax 40.4 additional (.array~of(bad)) i 98.900
syntax 40.4 array (bad) off 98.900
syntax 40.4 array (bad) r 98.900
syntax 40.4 array (bad) i 98.900
%SRCG%COUNT 26
%SRCG%L/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
%SRCG%L/*                                                                            */
%SRCG%L/* Copyright (c) 2026 Rexx Language Association. All rights reserved.          */
%SRCG%L/*                                                                            */
